00:21:59.160 --> 00:21:59.980
Wow! Look at that!

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:16.680
Two holes in one in the same day.

00:22:17.010 --> 00:22:18.410
First Mr. Stebbins and now you.

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:22.940
Oh, boy, wait till everybody back at the clubhouse hears that you made a hole in one.

00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:25.900
Oh, boy, I can't wait till they...

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:44.270
Keep your mouth shut.

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:59.970
I'll be back in just a moment, but first...

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:13.760
Jack, I thought you told me you gave that caddy five bucks to keep his mouth shut.

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:14.620
I did.

00:23:15.380 --> 00:23:16.820
Well, then how'd they find out about it?

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:19.880
Only I would run into a talking squirrel.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:23.400
What?

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:24.660
Never mind.

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:29.890
Good night, folks.

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:30.490
Thank you.
